   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IAS AIDS conference in Durban</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">IAS AIDS konferens i Durban</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen ska m&#xf6;jlig&#xf6;ra att arrangera aktiviteter som det av det Regionala SRHR teamet ansvarar f&#xf6;r under IAC konferensen i Durban i juli 2016. Detta inkluderar arrangemanget av en svensk utst&#xe4;llningsmonter,ett satelit event, informationsmaterial om det regionala SRHR teamet och andra relaterade kostnader.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To facilitate the events that the Regional SRHR team will be holding during the IAC conference in Durban in July 2016. This includes facilitating a Swedish booth, a satellite event, information material about the Regional SRHR Team and other incidental costs.</narrative>
  </description>
